  Missing parentheses around the arithmetic, so + binds as string concatenation. The sibling populators
  (LoanWorkbookPopulator.setNames, SavingsWorkbookPopulator.setNames, …) already use (size() + 1) and are unaffected.

  Proposed fix

  {code:java}
  clientsGroup.setRefersToFormula(CLIENT_SHEET_NAME + "!$B$2:$B$" + (clients.size() + 1));
