  same name and POI throws IllegalArgumentException: The workbook already contains this name, 500-ing the template. Note
  that Excel defined names are case-insensitive, so two products whose names differ only in case and/or surrounding
  whitespace (e.g. Target Savings and TARGET SAVINGS ) also collide. The loan-repayment / transaction templates already
  got an analogous guard for the per-client account names; the product/charge loops in the opening templates were missed.

